WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:10.851
&gt;&gt;&gt; President volodymr zelenskyy

00:00:10.984 --> 00:00:12.386
wrapped up a news conference at

00:00:12.519 --> 00:00:14.087
the g7 conference in Hiroshima

00:00:14.221 --> 00:00:16.557
as the Wagner group says it has

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:17.057
captured bakhmut.

00:00:17.191 --> 00:00:18.192
&gt;&gt; Zelenskyy denies that the

00:00:18.325 --> 00:00:19.193
city is in Russian hands.

00:00:19.326 --> 00:00:21.762
He just added that and addressed

00:00:21.862 --> 00:00:21.995
it.

00:00:22.129 --> 00:00:25.332
Let's take a listen.

00:00:25.766 --> 00:00:26.967
&gt;&gt; Translator: We don't have

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.137
simple questions anymore as well

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:31.772
as we don't have simple answers

00:00:31.772 --> 00:00:33.440
because we have a very

00:00:33.774 --> 00:00:35.142
complicated neighbor who is a

00:00:35.275 --> 00:00:36.710
criminal and terrorist, a

00:00:36.844 --> 00:00:38.345
complicated enemy.

00:00:38.479 --> 00:00:41.849
But we are keeping on, we are

00:00:41.982 --> 00:00:43.383
fighting thanks to the courage

00:00:43.784 --> 00:00:45.786
of our people, our warriors, and

00:00:45.853 --> 00:00:48.121
thanks to our cleverness.

00:00:48.255 --> 00:00:48.822
We are not throwing people to

00:00:48.956 --> 00:00:49.089
die.

00:00:49.223 --> 00:00:50.891
For us, the people are treasure.

00:00:51.024 --> 00:00:52.359
This is the most important thing

00:00:52.493 --> 00:00:53.060
that we have.

00:00:53.193 --> 00:00:55.796
And there are no

00:00:55.863 --> 00:00:56.230
misunderstandings.

00:00:56.363 --> 00:00:56.930
I clearly understand what is

00:00:57.064 --> 00:00:58.198
taking place in bakhmut and we

00:00:58.332 --> 00:00:59.800
all clearly understand why all

00:00:59.933 --> 00:01:04.071
of that is taking place.

00:01:04.404 --> 00:01:06.640
I cannot share with you the

00:01:06.773 --> 00:01:08.876
technical views of our military,

00:01:09.009 --> 00:01:10.344
of ours warriors.

00:01:10.477 --> 00:01:12.646
But we can see that the country

00:01:12.779 --> 00:01:14.648
which a dozen times is bigger

00:01:14.781 --> 00:01:17.317
than we are cannot occupy us,

00:01:17.451 --> 00:01:18.652
cannot win in this war and we

00:01:18.785 --> 00:01:19.820
understand that a bit more and

00:01:19.853 --> 00:01:21.188
then we will be prevailing.

00:01:21.321 --> 00:01:23.824
And that is why we are acting

00:01:23.924 --> 00:01:26.260
how we are acting, valuing the

00:01:26.393 --> 00:01:27.895
lives of the people.

00:01:28.028 --> 00:01:31.365
The hardest is if bakhmut had

00:01:31.498 --> 00:01:38.272
some military tech mistake,

00:01:38.405 --> 00:01:39.006
experience, and people could be

00:01:39.139 --> 00:01:39.406
surrounded.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:40.140
Then all the military know what

00:01:40.274 --> 00:01:41.842
could happen.

00:01:41.842 --> 00:01:42.943
How we could create the

00:01:43.076 --> 00:01:45.846
situation for people not to be

00:01:45.846 --> 00:01:45.946
captured.

00:01:46.079 --> 00:01:47.047
Now our people are accomplishing

00:01:47.314 --> 00:01:48.882
a very important mission.

00:01:49.016 --> 00:01:50.651
They are now in bakhmut.

00:01:50.784 --> 00:01:54.354
I will not share where exactly,

00:01:54.488 --> 00:01:56.290
but bakhmut is not occupied by

00:01:56.423 --> 00:01:59.092
Russian Federation as of today.

00:01:59.226 --> 00:02:00.193
There are no two or three

00:02:00.327 --> 00:02:04.565
interpretations of those words.

00:02:04.698 --> 00:02:06.133
&gt;&gt; Sam kiley and Kim dozer are

00:02:06.266 --> 00:02:07.501
back with us now.

00:02:07.868 --> 00:02:09.870
Sam, let me start with you.

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:11.071
Wagner claimed to have control

00:02:11.204 --> 00:02:11.905
of bakhmut before.

00:02:12.039 --> 00:02:13.340
Is there any reason -- certainly

00:02:13.473 --> 00:02:17.945
in the context of what we just

00:02:18.078 --> 00:02:18.679
heard from president zelenskyy

00:02:18.812 --> 00:02:19.913
to believe that that's any more

00:02:20.047 --> 00:02:20.581
believable now than it was

00:02:20.714 --> 00:02:25.085
several months ago?

00:02:25.218 --> 00:02:27.354
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Well, I mean, the

00:02:27.487 --> 00:02:30.457
leader of the Wagner group,

00:02:30.591 --> 00:02:33.360
yevgeny prigozhin, is likely to

00:02:33.493 --> 00:02:35.896
be identified as the leader of a

00:02:35.896 --> 00:02:37.898
terrorist organization.

00:02:37.931 --> 00:02:39.900
He has already identified as a

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:40.867
leader of a transnational

00:02:41.001 --> 00:02:42.970
criminal organization.

00:02:43.103 --> 00:02:43.904
His people have bludgeoned their

00:02:44.037 --> 00:02:45.939
own people to death with

00:02:46.073 --> 00:02:48.342
sledgehammers when they have

00:02:48.475 --> 00:02:51.345
been returned as prisoners of

00:02:51.478 --> 00:02:51.912
war to their care.

00:02:51.979 --> 00:02:55.382
So I think the simple answer is

00:02:55.515 --> 00:02:55.916
no.

00:02:55.949 --> 00:02:57.918
Statements coming from Wagner

00:02:57.985 --> 00:02:59.920
leader prigozhin, he likes to

00:03:00.053 --> 00:03:01.355
make these dramatic statements

00:03:01.488 --> 00:03:05.926
on an almost daily basis, gar

00:03:05.926 --> 00:03:06.994
garnering unwanted media

00:03:07.127 --> 00:03:08.629
attention and the battle for

00:03:08.762 --> 00:03:11.932
bakhmut is going to ebb and

00:03:11.932 --> 00:03:12.065
flow.

00:03:12.199 --> 00:03:13.400
They may or may not be dominant

00:03:13.533 --> 00:03:15.435
in the urbanized area.

00:03:15.569 --> 00:03:16.737
They are certainly under

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:18.338
pressure on the flanks.

00:03:18.472 --> 00:03:19.473
The Ukrainians are insisting

00:03:19.606 --> 00:03:20.674
that they still have people in

00:03:20.807 --> 00:03:24.678
the urban area and claiming

00:03:24.811 --> 00:03:27.981
short-term victories simply

00:03:28.115 --> 00:03:28.615
illustrating a failure to

00:03:28.749 --> 00:03:32.252
understand the battle is dynamic

00:03:32.386 --> 00:03:33.553
rather than static occasions.

00:03:33.954 --> 00:03:35.956
They don't end like a soccer

00:03:36.089 --> 00:03:36.256
match.

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:37.958
They continue indefinitely until

00:03:38.058 --> 00:03:40.293
there is an absolute result.

00:03:40.427 --> 00:03:41.962
The Ukrainians could be in the

00:03:41.962 --> 00:03:43.964
process of encircling what

00:03:43.964 --> 00:03:46.233
remains of the Wagner group in

00:03:46.366 --> 00:03:48.435
the free fire zone now if it is

00:03:48.568 --> 00:03:49.536
clear of Ukrainian troops and

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:52.272
they are likely to be sitting in

00:03:52.406 --> 00:03:56.309
a trap rather than victorious.

00:03:56.443 --> 00:04:00.747
&gt;&gt; Kim dozer, let's talk about

00:04:00.881 --> 00:04:01.982
the big picture in regards to

00:04:01.982 --> 00:04:04.151
the results of this g7 summit.

00:04:04.284 --> 00:04:06.119
There was one picture that I saw

00:04:06.253 --> 00:04:07.621
of zelenskyy having that family

00:04:07.988 --> 00:04:10.691
photo with all the g7 leaders

00:04:10.824 --> 00:04:12.292
flanked by them.

00:04:12.426 --> 00:04:14.695
Hugely symbolic to show

00:04:14.828 --> 00:04:15.996
solidarity and support behind

00:04:16.129 --> 00:04:16.997
Ukraine and of course you heard

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:20.901
about the military aid package,

00:04:21.034 --> 00:04:21.568
$375 million that president

00:04:22.002 --> 00:04:24.004
Biden just announced.

00:04:24.004 --> 00:04:25.305
More consequentially the f-16

00:04:25.439 --> 00:04:26.707
jets that will be exported and

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.208
the pilots will be trained on

00:04:28.341 --> 00:04:29.609
that and of course that will

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.044
take some time for the

00:04:31.178 --> 00:04:32.012
Ukrainians to see those jets in

00:04:32.012 --> 00:04:33.613
use.

00:04:34.014 --> 00:04:36.016
What was your biggest takeaway

00:04:36.016 --> 00:04:38.652
in terms of measuring success

00:04:38.785 --> 00:04:42.389
for zelenskyy regarding the g7?

00:04:42.522 --> 00:04:45.258
&gt;&gt; The fact that European

00:04:45.392 --> 00:04:48.729
leaders now see this war as

00:04:48.862 --> 00:04:49.362
existential for them.

00:04:49.496 --> 00:04:53.266
When you go to Europe, talk to

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:54.668
whether it's someone in the

00:04:54.801 --> 00:04:58.071
baltic nations or a Brit, they

00:04:58.205 --> 00:05:00.407
have a very different perception

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:01.208
of Russia now.

00:05:01.341 --> 00:05:04.044
They think Russia is unhinged.

00:05:04.177 --> 00:05:06.046
And they feel like if they don't

00:05:06.046 --> 00:05:07.647
stop Russian forces in Ukraine,

00:05:08.048 --> 00:05:09.349
Russia will attack somewhere

00:05:09.483 --> 00:05:11.184
else, possibly a nato nation

00:05:11.318 --> 00:05:11.651
next time.

00:05:12.052 --> 00:05:15.455
So I think even if Washington's

00:05:15.589 --> 00:05:17.023
resolve somewhat ebbs after

00:05:17.157 --> 00:05:18.725
this, European resolve will not

00:05:18.859 --> 00:05:22.195
and you saw that in that photo.

00:05:22.329 --> 00:05:24.865
Also, the push among European

00:05:24.998 --> 00:05:27.100
nations to despite the threat of

00:05:27.234 --> 00:05:31.004
nuclear war by Russia, give the

00:05:31.138 --> 00:05:32.839
Ukrainians F-16s means that they

00:05:32.973 --> 00:05:34.574
are sealing this in terms of we

00:05:34.708 --> 00:05:37.210
need to help Ukraine win as soon

00:05:37.344 --> 00:05:41.548
as possible and we also need to

00:05:41.681 --> 00:05:43.517
help Ukraine supplant or prevent

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:44.885
any future Russian invasion that

00:05:45.018 --> 00:05:46.720
could threaten Kyiv again.

00:05:46.853 --> 00:05:48.088
And sophisticated technology

00:05:48.221 --> 00:05:50.257
like those jets does that, even

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:51.625
though it's going to take a

00:05:51.758 --> 00:05:54.861
minimum of roughly four to five

00:05:54.995 --> 00:05:55.562
months to train the Ukrainian

00:05:55.695 --> 00:05:56.096
pilots.

00:05:56.096 --> 00:05:58.465
And you also have to build the

00:05:58.598 --> 00:06:00.100
whole technical tail on the

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:02.102
ground, the support system, the

00:06:02.169 --> 00:06:02.969
contractors, the trained

00:06:03.103 --> 00:06:04.604
technicians that know how to

